{"id":"bc2571aa42af9da2","group":"29","path":"29/29-prop-ifp-monotone.md","title":"单调算子的 IFP 等于 LFP","display":"prop-ifp-monotone — 单调算子的 IFP 等于 LFP","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-prop-ifp-monotone","aliases":["29-prop-ifp-monotone"],"display":"prop-ifp-monotone — 单调算子的 IFP 等于 LFP","depends_on":["[[29-df-ifp]]","[[29-thm-finite-lfp]]"],"source_locator":"§9.1, p.142, DjVu scan 157","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-prop-ifp-monotone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-prop-ifp-monotone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-ifp-monotone — 单调算子的 IFP 等于 LFP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a713bbaa5e1d7ea4\" href=\"?note=a713bbaa5e1d7ea4\" title=\"29-df-ifp\">29-df-ifp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef09f4563b20da8e\" href=\"?note=ef09f4563b20da8e\" title=\"29-thm-finite-lfp\">29-thm-finite-lfp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§9.1, p.142, DjVu scan 157"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(F:\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span> 单调。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0=\\varnothing\">\\(X_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{i+1}=F(X_i)\">\\(X_{i+1}=F(X_i)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef09f4563b20da8e\" href=\"?note=ef09f4563b20da8e\" title=\"29-thm-finite-lfp\">29-thm-finite-lfp</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i^F\">\\(I_i^F\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a713bbaa5e1d7ea4\" href=\"?note=a713bbaa5e1d7ea4\" title=\"29-df-ifp\">29-df-ifp</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad I_i^F=X_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad I_i^F=X_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}X_i=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq U\\mid F(Y)\\subseteq Y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}X_i=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq U\\mid F(Y)\\subseteq Y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷页 142、扫描页 157 明确给出单调情形 IFP 与 LFP 相同。证明已补全：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i\\subseteq F(X_i)=X_{i+1}\">\\(X_i\\subseteq F(X_i)=X_{i+1}\\)</span>，故膨胀步中的并集不改变结果；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 归纳即可。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ifp","status":"resolved","id":"a713bbaa5e1d7ea4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ifp]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-finite-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"ef09f4563b20da8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-finite-lfp]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-finite-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"ef09f4563b20da8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X_0=\\varnothing$、$X_{i+1}=F(X_i)$ 见 [[29-thm-finite-lfp]]；$I_i^F$ 和 $\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)$ 见 [[29-df-ifp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ifp","status":"resolved","id":"a713bbaa5e1d7ea4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X_0=\\varnothing$、$X_{i+1}=F(X_i)$ 见 [[29-thm-finite-lfp]]；$I_i^F$ 和 $\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)$ 见 [[29-df-ifp]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)","display":false},{"tex":"X_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"X_{i+1}=F(X_i)","display":false},{"tex":"I_i^F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad I_i^F=X_i.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}X_i=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq U\\mid F(Y)\\subseteq Y\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X_i\\subseteq F(X_i)=X_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":1064,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ifp]]、[[29-prop-ifp-monotone]]、[[29-df-fo-ifp]]、[[29-thm-ifp-lfp]] — 膨胀不动点及其表达力"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-prop-ifp-monotone]]"}],"outgoing":["a713bbaa5e1d7ea4","ef09f4563b20da8e"]}